The '''Seal of the Family''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]] that gives its user 3% off on most shops.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Seal of the Family''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Lucius}} for {{c|10,000,000}} and a {{Item|Crooked Artifact}} after the [[player]] had bought at least {{Green|7}} items on the [[Dark Auction]].

The cumulative cost of purchasing a '''Seal of the Family''', factoring out coins spent on unique Dark Auction purchases, is {{C|12,500,000}} {{Gray|(10,000,000 + 2,000,000 + 500,000)}}: this includes the cost of the {{Item|Crooked Artifact}} and {{Item|Shady Ring}}.

If the player loses the item, it can be repurchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} in the {{zone|Gold Mine}} for {{c|10,000,000}}.

